# AB-019: A phosphate buffer protects near-neutral pH
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H3PO4 0.002mol
add v1 NaOH 0.003mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
measure v2 ph
add v1 HCl 0.0002mol
add v2 HCl 0.0002mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
